  "interpretation": "<ul data-start=\"1288\" data-end=\"1650\">\n<li data-start=\"1288\" data-end=\"1360\">\n<p data-start=\"1290\" data-end=\"1360\">Elevated urine lead levels may indicate recent exposure to lead.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1361\" data-end=\"1445\">\n<p data-start=\"1363\" data-end=\"1445\">Creatinine correction helps normalize concentration due to hydration status.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1446\" data-end=\"1533\">\n<p data-start=\"1448\" data-end=\"1533\">Clinical correlation and blood lead levels are recommended for exposure assessment.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1534\" data-end=\"1650\">\n<p data-start=\"1536\" data-end=\"1650\">Occupational exposure, environmental source investigation, or chelation therapy may be considered based on levels.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
